@startuml
skinparam defaultFontName PingFang SC
skinparam defaultFontSize 15
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 65
hide footbox
title UC03 采购新书入库顺序图
actor "图书采购人员" as P
boundary PurchaseUI as UI
control PurchaseController as C
entity Book as Book
entity BookCopy as Copy
control ReservationController as RC
boundary NotifyBoundary as N
P -> UI : registerArrival(bookInfo, copyIds)
UI -> C : registerArrival(bookInfo, copyIds)
C -> C : 校验入库复本非空且编号唯一
alt 输入无效或复本重复入库
 C --> UI : 拒绝入库，不增加馆藏
else 入库数据合法
 note over P,UI : 采购与到货是系统外实物活动，界面登记已到货新书
 group 原子事务 T3
  C -> Book : ensureBook(bookInfo)
  Book --> C : bookId
  C -> Copy : addCopies(bookId, copyIds)
  note right of Copy : 新复本状态 AVAILABLE
  C -> RC : activate(bookId)
  ref over RC : 共享顺序图 预约激活 A1
  RC --> C : noticeList
 end
 opt noticeList 非空，事务提交后
  C -> N : sendReadyNotices(noticeList)
  ref over N : UC_EXT01 通知预约读者
  N --> C : 通知结果
 end
 C --> UI : 返回入库与预约激活结果
end
UI --> P : 展示结果
note over C,RC : 激活数量不超过当前可用复本数；没有预约则仅增加馆藏
@enduml
